WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.200
Meet BuckChats. Bringing the world together. One community, with more ways to connect.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.000
Go live, share your talent, and be part of the moment.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:18.000
Explore rooms built around music, shared interests, cities, and communities.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:26.500
Bring the energy to VS: friendly creator showdowns, with your community cheering you on.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:34.400
Jump into BuckChats Games, from arcade favourites to worlds you can build and explore.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:41.800
Keep the conversation going with private messaging, friends, and your own profile.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:51.700
Discover opportunities to earn Bucks through eligible virtual gifts and referrals. Eligibility and program rules apply.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.400
Live. Play. Connect. Grow.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:00.000
BuckChats. Coming soon. Join the community.
